 indexed grammar is an extension of a context-free grammar, and the class of languages generated by indexed grammars has closure properties and decidability results similar to those for context-free languages. The class of languages generated by indexed grammars properly includes all context-free languages and is a proper subset of the class of context-sensitive languages. Several subclasses of indexed grammars generate interesting classes of languages.},\n issn = {0004-5411},\n issue_date = {Oct. 1968}\n}"}]},{"relation":"meta","args":[{"t":"entry","v":"AhoIndexed"},{"t":"str","v":"container"},{"t":"str","v":"J. ACM"}]},{"relation":"meta","args":[{"t":"entry","v":"AhoIndexed"},{"t":"str","v":"doi"},{"t":"str","v":"10.1145/321479.321488"}]},{"relation":"meta","args":[{"t":"entry","v":"AhoIndexed"},{"t":"str","v":"entry-type"},{"t":"str","v":"article"}]},{"relation":"meta","args":[{"t":"entry","v":"AhoIndexed"},{"t":"str","v":"month"},{"t":"int","v":10}]},{"relation":"meta","args":[{"t":"entry","v":"AhoIndexed"},{"t":"str","v":"number"},{"t":"str","v":"4"}]},{"relation":"meta","args":[{"t":"entry","v":"AhoIndexed"},{"t":"str","v":"pages"},{"t":"str","v":"647–671"}]},{"relation":"meta","args":[{"t":"entry","v":"AhoIndexed"},{"t":"str","v":"publisher"},{"t":"str","v":"Association for Computing Machinery"}]},{"relation":"meta","args":[{"t":"entry","v":"AhoIndexed"},{"t":"str","v":"url"},{"t":"str","v":"https://doi.org/10.1145/321479.321488"}]},{"relation":"meta","args":[{"t":"entry","v":"AhoIndexed"},{"t":"str","v":"venue"},{"t":"str","v":"jacm"}]},{"relation":"meta","args":[{"t":"entry","v":"AhoIndexed"},{"t":"str","v":"visibility"},{"t":"str","v":"public"}]},{"relation":"meta","args":[{"t":"entry","v":"AhoIndexed"},{"t":"str","v":"volume"},{"t":"str","v":"15"}]},{"relation":"meta","args":[{"t":"entry","v":"AhoIndexed"},{"t":"str","v":"year"},{"t":"int","v":1968}]},{"relation":"path","args":[{"t":"entry","v":"AhoIndexed"},{"t":"str","v":"entries/refs/AhoIndexed/AhoInde